														<r3d:remarks>Catena uses VRA Core 3.0 metadata standards http://membership.vraweb.org/projects/vracore3/categories.html. What is a Catena?
A catena is a water chain, a feature frequently found in villa gardens. These water chains connect nature, architecture, and sculpture, drawing visitors from one part of a garden to another, just as a database links together images, people, places, and concepts.
Institutions for providing support to the project: http://catena.bgc.bard.edu/part_inst.htm. - Links überprüft 15.12.2017 Re</r3d:remarks>
